{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"863aa7b1543849e3cfd2c559a4715af74ecbeb9dde4c86853162816b04e9f732","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":30,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華給他子民的應許"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華的話臨到耶利米說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「耶和華－以色列的上帝如此說：你將我對你說過的一切話都寫在書上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和華說：日子將到，我要使我的百姓以色列和猶大被擄的人歸回；我也要使他們回到我所賜給他們列祖之地，他們就得這地為業。這是耶和華說的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"以下是耶和華論到以色列和猶大所說的話：","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶和華如此說：我們聽見聲音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是戰抖懼怕而不平安的聲音。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們且訪問看看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"男人有產難嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎麼看見人人用手掐腰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像產難的婦人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"臉面都變青了呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哀哉！那日為大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無日可比；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是雅各遭難的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他必被救出來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["萬軍之耶和華說：「到那日，我必從你頸項上折斷仇敵的軛，扭開他的繩索；外邦人不得再使你作他們的奴僕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["你們卻要事奉耶和華－你們的上帝和我為你們所要興起的王大衛。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"故此，耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的僕人雅各啊，不要懼怕；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，不要驚惶；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我要從遠方拯救你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從被擄到之地拯救你的後裔；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各必回來得享平靖安逸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人使他害怕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我與你同在，要拯救你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也要將所趕散你到的那些國滅絕淨盡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻不將你滅絕淨盡，倒要從寬懲治你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬不能不罰你","poem":1},{"noteId":30},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的損傷無法醫治；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的傷痕極其重大。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人為你分訴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你的傷痕得以纏裹；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你沒有醫治的良藥。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你所親愛的都忘記你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不來探問","poem":1},{"noteId":31},{"text":"你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因你的罪孽甚大，罪惡眾多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"曾用仇敵加的傷害傷害你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用殘忍者的懲治懲治你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你為何因損傷哀號呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的痛苦無法醫治。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我因你的罪孽甚大，罪惡眾多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"曾將這些加在你身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"故此，凡吞吃你的必被吞吃；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的敵人個個都被擄去；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擄掠你的必成為擄物；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"搶奪你的必成為掠物。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：我必使你痊癒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"醫好你的傷痕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都因人稱你為被趕散的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說：這是錫安，無人來探問","poem":1},{"noteId":32},{"text":"的！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使雅各被擄去的帳棚歸回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必顧惜他的住處。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城必建造在原舊的山岡；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宮殿也照舊有人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必有感謝和歡樂的聲音從其中發出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使他們增多，不致減少；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們尊榮，不致卑微。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的兒女要如往日；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的會眾堅立在我面前；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡欺壓他們的，我必刑罰他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的君王必是屬乎他們的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掌權的必從他們中間而出。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使他就近我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他也要親近我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不然，誰有膽量親近我呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要作我的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要作你們的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"看哪，耶和華的忿怒","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像暴風已經發出；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是掃滅的暴風，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必轉到惡人的頭上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的烈怒必不轉消，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到他心中所擬定的成就了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"末後的日子你們要明白。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":30,"caller":"-","text":"不罰你：或譯以你為無罪","reference":{"chapter":30,"verse":11}},{"noteId":31,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：理會","reference":{"chapter":30,"verse":14}},{"noteId":32,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：理會","reference":{"chapter":30,"verse":17}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/30.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/31.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/29.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}